# Review agent tool for post-commit hook (opencode, claude, codex)
# Defaults to opencode if not set.
# REVIEW_AGENT_TOOL=opencode

# Full site URL (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md): used for canonical URLs, OG images,
# sitemap and robots. astro.config.mjs and src/config/site.config.ts resolve
# it from the same Vite env source, so one value governs both sides.
# Precedence: process env (CI sets this) > .env.production > .env.
# .env.production already pins https://weshall.build for production builds;
# create a local .env (e.g. SITE_URL=http://localhost:4321) only to override.
# SITE_URL=https://weshall.build
